91	 * index.html so a browser refresh on a client route works. OfficeFloor REST routes and Spring
92	 * endpoints are matched first; only unmatched, non-{@code api/} paths fall through to the SPA.
93	 * TODO: confirm the API path prefix used by the OfficeFloor routes ("api/" assumed here).
